===========================================================================
veil reads ${PKG_SYSCONFDIR}/config.toml. The default one serves
${PREFIX}/share/veil/www on http://127.0.0.1:8080/ and drops privileges to
the veil user.

	echo veil=YES >> /etc/rc.conf
	service veil start
	curl http://127.0.0.1:8080/
===========================================================================
